stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> pending_driver: engine assigns / admin manual create

    pending_driver --> accepted: driver accepts
    pending_driver --> rejected: driver rejects
    pending_driver --> cancelled: admin cancels / offer expires

    accepted --> en_route_pickup: (same call as accept)
    accepted --> cancelled

    en_route_pickup --> at_pickup: driver marks arrived
    en_route_pickup --> cancelled

    at_pickup --> boarded: driver boards guest(s)
    at_pickup --> cancelled

    boarded --> completed: driver drops last stop
    boarded --> cancelled

    completed --> [*]
    cancelled --> [*]
    rejected --> [*]: guests re-queued, driver blacklisted for this entry

    unassignable --> pending_driver: re-matched by engine
    unassignable --> cancelled

    note right of rejected
        TripService.transition() is the ONLY
        place trip.status is mutated. Any
        transition not in the allowed map
        throws a 409 ConflictError.
    end note
